# Misc API keys for individual TOOLS -- NOT LLM provider keys.
#
# LLM provider credentials (OpenAI, Anthropic, etc.) live in providers.json,
# managed by credentials.py -- they are NOT read from here. This file is
# exclusively for one-off secrets that a specific tool needs to call some
# third-party grounding/research service.
#
# Copy this file to .env and fill in only the keys your registered tools
# actually need. Leave the rest blank -- env_secrets.get_env_secret() will
# raise a clear error at the point of use if a tool needs a key you never
# set, rather than failing silently with an empty string.

GITHUB_API_TOKEN=
NVD_API_KEY=
